---
title: "Krewire — Modular Go Libraries for Every Workload"
description: "End-to-end digital SDLC ecosystem in Go — secure, sustainable, scalable. One CLI kiw, one config krewire.yaml, every workload: app, cli, site, book, worker, service, infra, runtime."
layout: Landing
---

